# oracle: compute event/displace (compute_event_displace.html) in ordinary runs: each run and minimize stores its starting positions as the reference, so a 0.8 length unit displacement of every atom between two runs gives flag 0; the flag becomes 1 when an atom moves more than the threshold during a run (threshold 0.5)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=none rel=1e-10 abs=1e-12
units           lj
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
timestep        0.005
fix             1 all nve
velocity        all set 0.0 0.0 0.0
compute         ev all event/displace 0.5
thermo_style    custom step pe c_ev
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          1
run             0
displace_atoms  all move 0.8 0 0 units box
run             0
velocity        all set 0.3 0.0 0.0
run             4
velocity        all set 40.0 0.0 0.0
run             4
